Thanks for the screenshot. Two things are happening: the badge is positioned from the icon's centre, and the tab bar ignores the home indicator. The fix:

```css
.tabbar {
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
}
.tab-badge {
  top: 6px;
  right: calc(50% - 18px);
}
```

Applied in [[src/app/layout.css]]. Reopen the home-screen app to pick it up.
